# Force LF in the working tree for all text files, regardless of core.autocrlf.
# The Workflow tool reads workflow *.mjs scripts RAW and rejects any control
# character (a CR from CRLF counts) — so CRLF checkouts on Windows break every
# engine at load time. Normalize everything to LF; this is a text-only repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-braces: the engine scripts must never carry CR.
*.mjs text eol=lf
*.md  text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Common binaries — never touch their bytes.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
